# API guide

The library's API by task, with code that compiles.

## The shape of the API

| Group | Calls |
| --- | --- |
| Lifecycle | `Initialize()`, `IsInitialized()`, `Deinitialize()`, `Clear()` |
| Use | `Push()`, `Average()`, `GetCount()`, `GetConfig()` |
| Version | `xmpl100::GetVersion()` |

